rsity or scholarship recipient."}]]}]]}]}]
1c:["$","div",null,{"className":"site-shell content-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"content-main","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"editorial-contact","children":["Published by ",["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/editorial-policy/","children":"AspireCompass Editorial Team"}]," · Editorial contact: ",["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/team/hafiz-umar-farooq/","children":"Hafiz Umar Farooq"}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"quick-answer","aria-labelledby":"quick-answer-title","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"quick-answer-title","children":"The short answer"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Some Chinese application routes are free, while others waive a fee only for specific applicants or scholarship recipients. A free CSC form does not remove every university charge. Compare the precise programme, intake and payment stage before shortlisting."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"answer-next","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Next step:"}]," ","Choose your degree and intended intake, then inspect the official evidence for each row. Unknown fees are not treated as zero."]}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Useful next steps","children":[["$","$L4","#official-sources",{"href":"#official-sources","children":["Official sources",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/team/hafiz-umar-farooq/",{"href":"/team/hafiz-umar-farooq/","children":["Editorial contact",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}],false,false,false,["$","details",null,{"className":"mobile-contents","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"On this page: jump to your answer"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Article sections","children":[["$","a","Read fee status before the university name",{"href":"#section-1","children":"Read fee status before the university name"}],["$","a","Documented fee-free routes: degree and channel matter",{"href":"#section-2","children":"Documented fee-free routes: degree and channel matter"}],["$","a","Conditional and historical waivers: keep them separate",{"href":"#section-3","children":"Conditional and historical waivers: keep them separate"}],["$","a","What you may still pay when the application is free",{"href":"#section-4","children":"What you may still pay when the application is free"}],["$","a","A five-step verification method you can repeat",{"href":"#section-5","children":"A five-step verification method you can repeat"}],["$","a","Match the fee route to the scholarship route",{"href":"#section-6","children":"Match the fee route to the scholarship route"}],["$","a","Build a shortlist with a reason for each choice",{"href":"#section-7","children":"Build a shortlist with a reason for each choice"}]]}]]}],false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[["$","section","0-Read fee status before the university name",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Read fee status before the university name"}],[["$","p","This is a selected, independently checked route comparison, not a claim that every programme at each university is free to apply to. “No application fee” says nothing by itself about tuition, accommodation, admission deposits, financial-aid forms or the chance of receiving a scholarship.",{"children":"This is a selected, independently checked route comparison, not a claim that every programme at each university is free to apply to. “No application fee” says nothing by itself about tuition, accommodation, admission deposits, financial-aid forms or the chance of receiving a scholarship."}],["$","p","The records below were checked on 20 October 2026. A next-year self-funded admission guide, a current international undergraduate route and a scholarship authority route answer different questions; keep their conditions attached when making your shortlist.",{"children":"The records below were checked on 20 October 2026. A next-year self-funded admission guide, a current international undergraduate route and a scholarship authority route answer different questions; keep their conditions attached when making your shortlist."}]],"$undefined","$L1e","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24"]}],false,"$L25","$L26"]}],"$L27"]}]
