1f:["$","section","1-Documented fee-free routes: degree and channel matter",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Documented fee-free routes: degree and channel matter"}],[["$","p","Shanghai University of Engineering Science’s 2027 self-funded guide exempts degree programmes from the application fee, while its non-degree language programme has a separate charge. Duke Kunshan’s international undergraduate checklist states no application fee for its 2027 Common App route. Neither statement establishes a full scholarship.",{"children":"Shanghai University of Engineering Science’s 2027 self-funded guide exempts degree programmes from the application fee, while its non-degree language programme has a separate charge. Duke Kunshan’s international undergraduate checklist states no application fee for its 2027 Common App route. Neither statement establishes a full scholarship."}],["$","p","HUST’s official scholarship information distinguishes the Type A dispatching-authority route from paid Type B university routes. The free Type A route is not permission to ignore the home-country authority’s instructions or assume a Type B application is free.",{"children":"HUST’s official scholarship information distinguishes the Type A dispatching-authority route from paid Type B university routes. The free Type A route is not permission to ignore the home-country authority’s instructions or assume a Type B application is free."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Selected routes with direct official evidence","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Selected routes with direct official evidence"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Institution and route",{"scope":"col","children":"Institution and route"}],["$","th","Degree/intake",{"scope":"col","children":"Degree/intake"}],["$","th","Fee position",{"scope":"col","children":"Fee position"}],["$","th","Timing or condition",{"scope":"col","children":"Timing or condition"}]],["$","th",null,{"scope":"col","children":"Next step"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Shanghai University of Engineering Science — degree admission"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Bachelor’s/master’s, 2027 self-funded guide"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Application fee exempt"}],["$","td","3",{"children":"Published application period: 1 January–15 June 2027; not yet open at check"}]],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"https://cie.sues.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/53/49/ceb6f0dc4b6389e3445cad84bae8/46c15a70-ea34-4eaf-9b4a-8f7ca78caa35.pdf","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["SUES official 2027 PDF"," ↗"]}]}]]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Duke Kunshan — international Common App"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Bachelor’s, 2027 entry"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"No application fee"}],["$","td","3",{"children":"Check Early/Regular Decision conditions and time zone"}]],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"https://admissions.dukekunshan.edu.cn/en/how-to-apply/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Duke Kunshan official checklist"," ↗"]}]}]]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"HUST — CSC Type A/Bilateral"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Covered study categories; 2027 information page"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"No application fee for the named channel"}],["$","td","3",{"children":"Apply through the relevant dispatching authority; country instructions control"}]],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"https://iso.hust.edu.cn/Scholarships/Scholarship_Information_and_Tips.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["HUST official channel comparison"," ↗"]}]}]]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
20:["$","section","2-Conditional and historical waivers: keep them separate",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Conditional and historical waivers: keep them separate"}],[["$","p","Nankai’s checked 2026 Type B guide states RMB 600 payable after admission and waived for Chinese Government Scholarship recipients. That is a historical, conditional record: applying for the scholarship is not the same as being awarded it, and the 2026 notice does not confirm a 2027 exemption.",{"children":"Nankai’s checked 2026 Type B guide states RMB 600 payable after admission and waived for Chinese Government Scholarship recipients. That is a historical, conditional record: applying for the scholarship is not the same as being awarded it, and the 2026 notice does not confirm a 2027 exemption."}],["$","p","Use historical entries as research leads rather than active recommendations. Before including one in a current application budget, obtain the new intake’s official fee wording. This small check prevents a list from becoming misleading simply because the year in its title changed.",{"children":"Use historical entries as research leads rather than active recommendations. Before including one in a current application budget, obtain the new intake’s official fee wording. This small check prevents a list from becoming misleading simply because the year in its title changed."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"A conditional record must retain its condition","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"A conditional record must retain its condition"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Institution",{"scope":"col","children":"Institution"}],["$","th","Named evidence",{"scope":"col","children":"Named evidence"}],["$","th","Interpretation",{"scope":"col","children":"Interpretation"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Nankai University"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"2026 Type B guide: RMB 600 after admission, waived for CGS recipients"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Closed prior-cycle example; not an unconditional free application or a confirmed 2027 rule"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Source: ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://ensie.nankai.edu.cn/info/1046/1336.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Official guidance"}]]}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
21:["$","section","3-What you may still pay when the application is free",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What you may still pay when the application is free"}],[["$","p","Make separate columns for application charge, tuition, accommodation, insurance, documents, tests, travel and any offer-acceptance payment. A university may waive the first column while the others remain substantial. Financial-aid assessment can also involve a service or evidence requirement separate from academic admission.",{"children":"Make separate columns for application charge, tuition, accommodation, insurance, documents, tests, travel and any offer-acceptance payment. A university may waive the first column while the others remain substantial. Financial-aid assessment can also involve a service or evidence requirement separate from academic admission."}],["$","p","Ask what a payment is for before assuming it contradicts a free application. A tuition deposit after admission is different from an application fee deferred until admission. Also check the refund terms: a refundable deposit and a non-refundable processing charge create different financial commitments.",{"children":"Ask what a payment is for before assuming it contradicts a free application. A tuition deposit after admission is different from an application fee deferred until admission. Also check the refund terms: a refundable deposit and a non-refundable processing charge create different financial commitments."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","aside",null,{"className":"worked-example","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Worked example"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Suppose Route A has a zero application fee but requires a language test and document translation, while Route B charges an application fee and accepts evidence you already hold. Compare the actual total and academic fit rather than selecting Route A solely because its first fee is zero."}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
22:["$","section","4-A five-step verification method you can repeat",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"A five-step verification method you can repeat"}],[["$","p","Start with the university’s current admission or scholarship notice, not a copied list. Find the exact words about the charge and read the surrounding applicant category. Then inspect whether the notice names the intake and degree. A general FAQ may be useful, but a more specific current call can add conditions.",{"children":"Start with the university’s current admission or scholarship notice, not a copied list. Find the exact words about the charge and read the surrounding applicant category. Then inspect whether the notice names the intake and degree. A general FAQ may be useful, but a more specific current call can add conditions."}],["$","p","If the fee is absent, ask the international office whether it is payable, when and by whom. Record the answer with the date. Do not turn silence into “free”. If two official pages conflict, identify the newer programme-specific notice and seek clarification before payment.",{"children":"If the fee is absent, ask the international office whether it is payable, when and by whom. Record the answer with the date. Do not turn silence into “free”. If two official pages conflict, identify the newer programme-specific notice and seek clarification before payment."}]],["$","ol",null,{"className":"process-steps","aria-label":"A five-step verification method you can repeat","children":[["$","li","Identify degree, programme, teaching language and intake.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":1}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Identify degree, programme, teaching language and intake."}]]}],["$","li","Open the official fee or application instructions.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":2}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Open the official fee or application instructions."}]]}],["$","li","Separate zero fee, waiver and delayed-payment wording.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":3}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Separate zero fee, waiver and delayed-payment wording."}]]}],["$","li","Check the authority or scholarship conditions controlling the route.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":4}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Check the authority or scholarship conditions controlling the route."}]]}],["$","li","Save the source and recheck before submitting.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":5}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Save the source and recheck before submitting."}]]}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
23:["$","section","5-Match the fee route to the scholarship route",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Match the fee route to the scholarship route"}],[["$","p","Type A and Type B are useful labels for government-scholarship research, but they do not determine every university’s fee policy. One university can charge differently for its direct admission, pre-admission request and scholarship-specific procedures. Keep the channel beside the amount in your tracker.",{"children":"Type A and Type B are useful labels for government-scholarship research, but they do not determine every university’s fee policy. One university can charge differently for its direct admission, pre-admission request and scholarship-specific procedures. Keep the channel beside the amount in your tracker."}],["$","p","For Pakistani applicants using an HEC or another sending-authority route, follow that authority’s current instructions instead of selecting a different channel solely because an internet list calls it free. Your academic application and funding nomination still need to be valid.",{"children":"For Pakistani applicants using an HEC or another sending-authority route, follow that authority’s current instructions instead of selecting a different channel solely because an internet list calls it free. Your academic application and funding nomination still need to be valid."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Match the fee route to the scholarship route","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/csc-scholarship-type-a-vs-type-b/",{"href":"/guides/csc-scholarship-type-a-vs-type-b/","children":["CSC Type A versus Type B",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/hec-chinese-government-scholarship/",{"href":"/guides/hec-chinese-government-scholarship/","children":["HEC Chinese Government Scholarship route",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/csc-scholarship-application/",{"href":"/guides/csc-scholarship-application/","children":["CSC application preparation",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
24:["$","section","6-Build a shortlist with a reason for each choice",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build a shortlist with a reason for each choice"}],[["$","p","Use a short list containing academic fit, eligible degree, language readiness, current route and total application cost. A route with no processing charge is not useful if you cannot meet its subject requirement or it is closed to your applicant category.",{"children":"Use a short list containing academic fit, eligible degree, language readiness, current route and total application cost. A route with no processing charge is not useful if you cannot meet its subject requirement or it is closed to your applicant category."}],["$","p","Keep confirmed current routes above historical or unconfirmed leads. Mark a published future opening as upcoming rather than open. After submission, retain receipts even when the charge is zero: proof of an application matters independently of proof of payment.",{"children":"Keep confirmed current routes above historical or unconfirmed leads. Mark a published future opening as upcoming rather than open. After submission, retain receipts even when the charge is zero: proof of an application matters independently of proof of payment."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L28",null,{"id":"guides/china-universities-without-application-fees:section-7","title":"Check your progress","items":["The university and programme names are exact.","The source names the applicable degree and intake.","The fee statement covers my channel.","Any waiver condition is satisfied, not merely hoped for.","Other study and application costs are budgeted.","The submission window is actually available to me."]}],"$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Build a shortlist with a reason for each choice","children":[["$","$L4","/countries/china/",{"href":"/countries/china/","children":["China study pathway",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/no-application-fee-scholarships/",{"href":"/guides/no-application-fee-scholarships/","children":["General no-application-fee scholarship guide",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
